    {
      "role": "agent",
      "action": "send_email(to=\"lisa.morgan@velocitypartners.io\", subject=\"call summary\", body=\"Hi Lisa,\n\nThank you for taking the time to speak with me today regarding the integration issues you're experiencing at Velocity Partners.\n\nHere's a summary of our call:\n\n**Issue:** API timeout issues encountered during integration.\n\n**Recommendation:** We suggested increasing the connection pool size to resolve the timeout issues.\n\n**Next Steps:** You will test the connection pool size increase on your end and call back if the issues persist.\n\nPlease don't hesitate to reach out if you have any questions or if you need further assistance. We'll follow up with you in a couple of days to see how the testing goes.\n\nBest regards,\nYour Support Team\")",
